@base = http://localhost:8000

### Сервис жив?
GET {{base}}/health

### Создать1
POST {{base}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Мурка",
  "kind": "кот",
  "age": 2,
  "owner": "Пётр"
}

### Создать2
POST {{base}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Бобик",
  "kind": "собака",
  "age": 10,
  "owner": "Василиса"
}
